      "content": "the separate lines idea is good. one thing though—the client is really particular about the \"vibe\" of the evening. they want it to feel high-end and seamless, not like a hospital ward or a cafeteria. how can we keep the dietary management very professional and discreet so it doesn't stand out or make the guests feel like they're being singled out? is there a way to bake it into the service so it feels natural?",
